      }
    },
    "Stopping…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在停止…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switched to desktop" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "切换到桌面"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switched to iPhone" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "切换到 iPhone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The page loads in a fresh, isolated browser. Its traffic goes through a proxy port opened only for this session, so every host listed belongs to this URL and nothing else." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "页面会在一个全新的隔离浏览器里加载。它的流量走一个只给本次会话使用的代理端口，所以列出的每个主机都只属于这个网址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The probe browser is a WKWebView with its own proxy setting (macOS 14+). Load the page, then click around: everything it does goes only to a port Tidemark opens for this session and on to Surge, so every connection belongs to this URL until you press Stop. Surge's records fill in the IP, policy and rule." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "探测用的浏览器是一个单独设置了代理的 WKWebView（macOS 14+）。页面加载后可以随意点击，它的所有流量都只连接 Tidemark 为本次会话打开的端口，再转发给 Surge，所以在你按下停止之前，每个连接都属于这个网址。IP、策略和规则由 Surge 的记录补全。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The probe's proxy did not open a port." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "探测代理没有打开端口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This session has ended. Start a new probe to keep browsing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本次会话已结束，开始新的探测才能继续浏览。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your clicks" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
